'''''Cistus populifolius''''', also known as '''poplar-leaved rock-rose'''<ref>{{Cite web |title=Cistus populifolius {{!}} poplar-leaved rock rose Shrubs/RHS |url=http://www.rhs.org.uk/plants/3879/cistus-populifolius/details |access-date=2026-04-28 |website=www.rhs.org.uk |language=en-gb}}</ref>, is a [[shrub]]by [[species]] of [[flowering plant]] in the family [[Cistaceae]].

==Phylogeny==
''Cistus populifolius'' belongs to the white and whitish pink flowered clade of ''Cistus'' species.

